--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Cutscene_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fd8513ac7884b2d4995e539561afdc7c, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 7127695360
    m_Localized: Long ago, a kingdom flourished in peace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 269967949824
    m_Localized: "And now\u2014\r\nthe hero's journey begins."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 121686720512
    m_Localized: "\u201CTo thee, I bestow the name of Hero.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 129530068992
    m_Localized: 'Placing his final hope in a single warrior,

      the king sent
      him forth into the world.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 101889605632
    m_Localized: "One day, darkness fell\u2014\r\nand with it came the Demon Lord.\r\nThe
      kingdom was plunged into despair."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 111125463040
    m_Localized: 'When all hope seemed lost,

      the king summoned one person.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92829908992
    m_Localized: But that peace did not last...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2775847699742720
    m_Localized: 'Thank you for your hard work, our hero!

      We are Lyn & Lisa
      sisters who will help you train.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2775870026022912
    m_Localized: I will train you the basic skills needed for the hero's adventure
      to defeat  the evil king.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2775877923897344
    m_Localized: 'First of all, I''ll tell you how to move!

      Keep the touch
      away from the button on the screen and the character will move in that direction.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2775893728034816
    m_Localized: I'll show you the destination on the screen, so please go to that
      place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2775906629713920
    m_Localized: 'It''s really <size=110%>GREAT</size> sir!

      You can change
      the way you move in the settings, so check it out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2775914577920000
    m_Localized: 'Can you see the gauge bar at the top of the screen?

      This
      bar is called a risk gauge, and it gets full every time the warrior moves.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2775930671464448
    m_Localized: 'The amount of danger increases depends on the level of the monster
      and you,

      The higher the risk, the higher the probability of encountering
      a monster.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2851736588386304
    m_Localized: Combat monsters by increasing the risk gauge through movement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2851746344337408
    m_Localized: 'It''s really <size=110%>GREAT, OUTSTANDING</size> sir!

      As
      you just experienced, the battle is done automatically.

      You and the
      monster take turns attacking.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2852407261790208
    m_Localized: 'If you win the battle, your battle point will be reduced by <color=#F13A4E>1</color>,

      If
      you lose, the battle point will be reduced by <color=#F13A4E>3</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2852408792711168
    m_Localized: 'When the battle point becomes <color=#F13A4E>0</color>, you will
      collapse with all your strength.

      It would be important to use battle
      points limited to 30 wisely.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2852876910592000
    m_Localized: If you win the battle, your level rises and you earn stat points
      of <color=#45b0f7>4</color> per level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2852884384841728
    m_Localized: 'You can invest the stat by pressing the <color=#45b0f7>+</color>
      button next to each stat.

      At first, I recommend you not to invest LUC,
      but to invest only HP, ATK, and DEF in a balanced way.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3133915335753728
    m_Localized: I pray for your luck. Please defeat the evil king!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2854499225436160
    m_Localized: 'That''s great! You''ve invested all your stat points.

      You
      can also set stat points to be distributed automatically every time you level
      up in the future.

      Press the auto distribution button to set it up!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2863382492872704
    m_Localized: 'It''s really <size=110%>GREAT, OUTSTANDING, EXCELLENT</size> sir!

      Among
      the stats, the LUC (Lucky) stats are not directly involved in combat, but they
      say they get more money from monsters or higher odds of getting the monster''s
      loot.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2879520270450688
    m_Localized: I think I've explained all the basics!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29277458202624000
    m_Localized: 'Welcome to your Territory, Hero!

      This is the territory
      granted to you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29308698968457216
    m_Localized: By talking with different merchants, you can use the money gathered
      by your predecessors to train yourself or acquire new gear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35473328967254016
    m_Localized: Next, I'll explain about the battle with monsters!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35470736392454144
    m_Localized: Press stat button to open Stats window
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35470623037194240
    m_Localized: Combat monsters by increasing the risk gauge through movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35470494146232320
    m_Localized: Move to the waypoint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2852876910592001
    m_Localized: Invest all the stat you get after opening the stat window by pressing
      the stat button at the top right of the screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35470736392454145
    m_Localized: Press + button to open stat distribute window and invest all stat
      points
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35470736392454146
    m_Localized: Press Auto Distribute button to open Auto Distribute window, and
      turn on the Auto Distribue setting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29277588377042944
    m_Localized: When you get close to the various merchants here, you can speak
      with them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29277588788084736
    m_Localized: 'Try talking to me to upgrade your territory!

      For the first
      time, I''ll upgrade it for you <color=#45b0f7>for free</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29308654248787968
    m_Localized: Great! Upgrading the territory has attracted a new equipment merchant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29308687186657280
    m_Localized: As you continue to develop your territory, more and more people
      will visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29309554367397888
    m_Localized: "When you're ready, begin your adventure.\r\nBe careful\u2014<color=#F13A4E>all
      the gold you currently have will disappear when you start!</color>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50001000000000000
    m_Localized: 'Congratulations on your first boss victory!

      You''ve earned
      a relic reward. Let me explain how it works.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50001000000000001
    m_Localized: 'You can choose one of the relics displayed here.

      Try select
      one relic.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50001000000000002
    m_Localized: 'This area shows the selected relic''s name, grade, and effect.

      Higher
      grade relics provide stronger effects.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50001000000000003
    m_Localized: 'Relics provide passive effects that help you in battle.

      Choose
      wisely based on your playstyle!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50001000000000004
    m_Localized: 'If you don''t like the current relics,

      you can use the
      reroll button to get new ones!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50001000000000005
    m_Localized: 'Reroll chances are limited, so use them wisely.

      I''ll add
      reroll count for you, so try pressing the reroll button now!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50002000000000000
    m_Localized: Select a reward relic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50002000000000001
    m_Localized: Press the reroll button to see new relics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50002000000000002
    m_Localized: Select one of the new relics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50002000000000003
    m_Localized: Press the acquire button to obtain the relic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50001000000000006
    m_Localized: 'Great job! You''ve successfully rerolled.

      Now, let''s choose
      a relic and acquire it!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50001000000000007
    m_Localized: 'Congratulations on getting your relic!

      You can check your
      owned relics in the Stats window.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50002000000000004
    m_Localized: Press the stat button to check the acquired relic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50001000000000008
    m_Localized: 'The relics you acquire will be displayed here.

      Relics provide
      various passive effects to help you in battle.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50001000000000009
    m_Localized: 'That''s all for the relic tutorial!

      Good luck on your adventure!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
